          "type": "text",
          "text": "Environmental officers noted high winds during seasonal storms while preparing a replacement frame. A sight line at the island ferry terminal makes an angle of 55° with level ground. The horizontal distance is 17 m. Find the vertical height x in metres, correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
